WEBVTT


1
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:03.520
Around 35 people in Ireland die from fire each year.

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.720
Many of these occur in domestic homes because people do not

3
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.600
have a working smoke alarm installed.

4
00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:11.760
We here in Dublin Fire Brigade support this European wide

5
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.920
campaign to encourage homeowners to install smoke alarms in

6
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:18.200
their homes. Every month we attend to incidents we can see

7
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.640
the difference that having a working smoke alarm makes.

8
00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:23.640
We encourage householders to install smoke alarms today.